    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.indentscope\n\n### Description\n\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/commit/1695f39f8343f1b129464c2811a01ee9aa61e636 - this commit causes the neovim splash screen (`:intro`) to disappear.\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.8.3 & nightly\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nStart neovim with no \"dashboard\" screen, the neovim splash screen will quickly disappear, this is used to be a common issue with statusline plugins creating highlight groups on init.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nExpect the splash screen to stay on screen.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nSplash screen quickly diappears.",
