            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thank you for the detailed answer @echasnovski!\r\n\r\nI use lazy.nvim (not packer) but the same applies, can’t lazy load mini anymore, once I change `lazy = false` the splash screen remains intact.\r\n\r\n> So I am not sure what can be done here. Highlight groups should be created for plugin to operate properly. They can all be created during startup, but that would affect its time and contradict with lazy loading of any module.\r\n\r\nI’m not sure either, but disabling lazy loading is a sufficient fix IMHO.\r\n\r\nTy again for all your amazing work, this plug-in has become a staple in any neovim installation, you should be nominated  for the “tpope of neovim” 😄 \r\n",
